# Inertia/momentum incorrect behavior, and unexpected value jumping#1026
## 🐛 Bug Report
This is a bug for tracking the overall not-quite-right behavior of 1:1 animation with momentum at the end.

## Expected behavior with reproduction
The desired behavior is exemplified by the native scrolling behavior on macOS with a trackpad -- 1:1 mapping of scroll gesture to position, with momentum proportional to the spring config when ending the gesture with velocity.

